<Slide style={{ padding: 60, background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 600 }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 20, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', letterSpacing: 2 }}>02 · 业务怎么用</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 4, borderRadius: 2, background: '#2563EB' }} />
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B', marginTop: 16, lineHeight: 1.2 }}>
            场景二｜重复的事交给定时任务：让该做的事自动发生
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E2E8F0', marginTop: 16 }} />

        {/* 横向时间轴，节点上下交错 */}
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, marginTop: 16, position: 'relative' }}>
            <svg width={1160} height={340} viewBox='0 0 1160 340'>
                <line x1='40' y1='170' x2='1120' y2='170' stroke='#C7D6F5' strokeWidth='2' />
                <circle cx='160' cy='170' r='9' fill='#2563EB' />
                <circle cx='440' cy='170' r='9' fill='#0891B2' />
                <circle cx='720' cy='170' r='9' fill='#2563EB' />
                <circle cx='1000' cy='170' r='11' fill='#F59E0B' />
                <line x1='160' y1='170' x2='160' y2='110' stroke='#C7D6F5' strokeWidth='1' />
                <line x1='440' y1='170' x2='440' y2='230' stroke='#C7D6F5' strokeWidth='1' />
                <line x1='720' y1='170' x2='720' y2='110' stroke='#C7D6F5' strokeWidth='1' />
                <line x1='1000' y1='170' x2='1000' y2='230' stroke='#C7D6F5' strokeWidth='1' />
            </svg>
            {/* 上排两卡 */}
            <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 20, top: 8, width: 280, background: '#E8EEFB', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>日报周报自动出稿</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>按时读数、生成摘要、推送到指定群，早上到岗即可看。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 580, top: 8, width: 280, background: '#E8EEFB', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>网页操作录成技能</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>一次后台操作录制下来，之后批量回放，不再重复手工。</Text>
            </Box>
            {/* 下排两卡 */}
            <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 300, top: 210, width: 280, background: '#D6E4F9', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>数据看板与预警</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>指标异常主动提醒，把「事后发现」变成「提前预警」。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 860, top: 210, width: 280, background: '#FFF7E9', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>主动关怀推送</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>续约、回款、保修到期前主动提醒，重要的事不再靠记性。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        {/* 结论条 */}
        <Box style={{ height: 62, background: '#E8EEFB', borderRadius: 10, padding: 16, marginTop: 12, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                自动化的收益不是省几次点击，而是让「该做但没人做」的事稳定发生——巡检、提醒、复盘不再依赖人的记性。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
